{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/Desc_Header1.png?t=1745240502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/Desc_Gif1.gif?t=1745240502\" />Destroy slimes with any of the weapons available to you - A turret, minigun, lasers, grenades, even a multi-turret! Some slimes are tougher than others, some even shoot back at you. Blow up enough of them, and you'll eventually level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/Desc_Header2.png?t=1745240502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/Desc_Gif2.gif?t=1745240502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every slime you kill drops experience orbs - Pick up enough to level up and get an upgrade of your choosing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/Desc_Header3.png?t=1745240502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/Desc_Gif3.gif?t=1745240502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more upgrades you get, the faster you kill slimes &gt; The faster you kill slimes, the more you level up &gt; The more you level up the more upgrades you get. It's a vicious cycle that eventually leads to total mayhem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">just be careful not to die in the process...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635450?t=1745240502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea